There used to be a Lojban room on MediaMOO, ages ago... I remember I
programmed some verbs there to handle cmene; even checked the cmene for
validity and used "la cmen." or "la'o gy. Character Name gy." as
appropriate (if you have a special Lojban name set on your character that
is) when people spoke, etc etc.  Dunno what ever became of it; been a long
time.

Hack&Slash-style DikuMUD or LPMud is probably not the Right Thing for a
Lojban environment, but a MUSH or MOO would work quite well.  Besides, I
tend to prefer those anyway.  I certainly know what it takes to run a MUSH
(I'm one of the admins of the KLI's MUSH that someone mentioned) and rather
like MOOs, though they take a bit more getting used to.

